WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.790
In Jerusalem, Acts describes
the first believers:

2
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.720
learning from the apostles,
eating together, and praying.

3
00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.720
They had all things in common, Luke says.

4
00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:15.450
A man called Barnabas sells a field and
lays the money at the apostles' feet.

5
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:19.510
Then a couple, Ananias and
Sapphira, sell land too.

6
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:22.630
Within hours, both of them are dead.

7
00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.230
So what kind of community was this?

8
00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:29.700
In this mission, you'll unpack the
four marks Luke gives the first church.

9
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:33.330
Then you'll ask whether
churches today should copy it.

10
00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:38.270
Your mission: find out what kind of
community the first church really was.
